			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750240101,
					"content": "亲爱的，你们的热情…真叫我招架不住，呼——先吃点冰，冷静一下头脑，之后我们慢慢聊，好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "伊卡尤"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240102,
					"content": "嘎呜——！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「金盏花」"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240103,
					"content": "起初听到「哎哟」一声惨叫，接着就是重物摔到地上的闷响，再之后只剩龙的呜呜声…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240104,
					"content": "欸？！那人没事吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240105,
					"content": "唔…它们围得死死的，不知道里面的人到底怎么样了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240106,
					"content": "派蒙从上边看看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240107,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240108,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}好像在说让它试试呢，那就交给它吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240109,
					"content": "呜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240110,
					"content": "呃，看起来情况不太妙的样子？那人该不会死…呸呸，说不定只是昏过去了，但不管怎么说，我们可不能见死不救呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240111,
					"content": "唔…麻烦三位借过一下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240112,
					"content": "嘎！呜！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「金盏花」"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240113,
					"content": "呜…呜呜？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「小波」"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240114,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「翡翠」"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240115,
					"content": "呜哇，它们完全不肯让开…到底怎么回事呀？听那人之前的话，应该也不是完全不认识的龙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240116,
					"content": "要是有更多线索就好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240117,
					"content": "…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240118,
					"content": "#欸？{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}！是发现什么了吗？我们快跟上吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7502402,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7502402
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_OR",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7502402",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7502402,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-2030.073,
							74.78,
							8497.404
						],
						"pointId": 8382
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-2032.248,
							74.7,
							8496.88
						],
						"pointId": 9621
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750240201,
					"content": "「…今天是雨天。为小波准备了它最爱的<color=#00E1FFFF>酸汁腌鱼</color>，看到它心满意足的样子，一切也都值得了…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240202,
					"content": "「…哪怕它原本在纵情畅游，但只要端出<color=#00E1FFFF>酸汁腌鱼</color>，它就会从水中跃出，那弧线堪称完美！…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240203,
					"content": "「…我是不会怀疑它对我的爱的，只是担心，会不会其实它爱<color=#00E1FFFF>酸汁腌鱼</color>更甚于我…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240204,
					"content": "小波…指的应该是鳍游龙吧，营地的锅里煮着的也是酸汁腌鱼，肯定是为它准备的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240205,
					"content": "「…圆溜溜的眼睛，卷卷的尾巴，神气快活的叫声…翡翠啊翡翠，这世上还会有比你更可爱的小龙吗？…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240206,
					"content": "「…从没受过欺骗，也不懂得怀疑，好像和这世上所有的生灵都能成为朋友，共享玩耍的乐趣…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240207,
					"content": "「…要不是太忙，我真想整日整夜陪你玩耍，看你在阳光斑驳的林间穿梭，好像风的孩子，无忧无虑的精灵！…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240208,
					"content": "#唔，看来那只小匿叶龙叫做翡翠，还是只贪玩的小龙。说不定{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也能跟它交上朋友呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240209,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240210,
					"content": "「…我遍踏丘陵与山谷，只为了寻得你的踪迹。如果你真的不待见我，大可以一走了之…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240211,
					"content": "「…但你却照顾我的脚程，走走停停，甚至为我收集许多颗粒果，还有那些亮晶晶的石块…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240212,
					"content": "「…我心爱的金盏花，只有我知道，硬壳包裹下是柔软体贴的心，好勇斗狠绝非你的本意…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "谁人的日志"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240213,
					"content": "呃…金盏花该不会是说那只脾气暴躁的嵴锋龙吧？那副气势汹汹把人击倒的样子，哪有一丝温柔体贴的影子啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240214,
					"content": "不过话说回来，原来这三只龙都是他的…朋友？到底为什么会把他撞昏还团团围住呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240215,
					"content": "先把人救出来再问吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240216,
					"content": "说的也是，要是有办法让龙让开就好了…对了，日志里不是说小波喜欢吃酸汁腌鱼吗？正好营地里也有，说不定能把它引开。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240217,
						750240219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240217,
					"content": "#让{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}和翡翠交朋友呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240218,
					"content": "#嗯！翡翠很贪玩，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}只要带它去旁边玩就好啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240221,
					"content": "呀！呀呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240222,
					"content": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}也很有干劲呢！不过我们还是先试试最简单的方法吧，酸汁腌鱼不吃不就浪费了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750240219,
					"content": "和金盏花决斗吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240220
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750240220,
					"content": "#还是先试试和平的手段吧！比如让{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}把贪玩的翡翠引开…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750240221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7502406,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7502406
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
